  artifact["Immutable build artifact"]
  checks["Commit-bound run / checks"]
  source -->|push / PR event| runner
  runner -->|read-only source token| sdk
  sdk -->|build and test| tests
  tests -->|publish tested bytes| artifact
  tests -->|TRX and conclusion| checks
  source -->|headSha provenance| checks
